# Multi-justifier survival ([IRET.12.3]): a derived fact lives while any
# justification stands. Two rules derive the same logical Alarm.
#
#   pump 1   Smoke and Heat both present -> Alarm derived, twice justified
#   pump 2   retract Smoke  -> one justification left, the Alarm survives
#   pump 3   retract Heat   -> none left, the Alarm is retracted
assert Smoke id=1
assert Heat id=1
pump
retract 0
pump
retract 1
pump
